 },
 "lineas": [
  {"texto": "On a mountain at the edge of the world, a stone drank sunlight for ten thousand years.", "pausa": 0.4,
   "cena": {"fundo": "pico-pedra", "cam": {"z": [1.05, 1.25], "x": [0.5, 0.5], "y": [0.55, 0.45]}, "fx": ["brilho", "neblina"], "brilho": [0.5, 0.4]}},
  {"texto": "One morning, it *cracked*.", "pausa": 0.3,
   "cena": {"fundo": "pico-pedra", "cam": {"z": [1.6, 1.75], "x": 0.5, "y": 0.42}, "fx": ["tremor@0.2", "flash@0.25", "faiscas", "brilho"], "brilho": [0.5, 0.42]}},
  {"texto": "A monkey of stone stepped out, and two beams of *gold* burst from his eyes.", "pausa": 0.4,
   "cena": {"fundo": "pico-pedra", "cam": {"z": [1.5, 1.3], "x": 0.5, "y": 0.62}, "fx": ["brilho", "neblina"], "brilho": [0.5, 0.35],
    "atores": [{"id": "wukong", "pose": "triunfo", "rosto": "choque", "u": 0.5, "v": 0.86, "esc": 1.1, "olhos_brilho": true}]}},
  {"texto": "The light pierced the clouds and hit the throne of the *Jade Emperor*.", "pausa": 0.4,
   "cena": {"fundo": "ceu-portao", "cam": {"z": [1.1, 1.3], "x": 0.5, "y": 0.55}, "fx": ["dourado", "flash@0.1"],
    "atores": [{"id": "imperador", "pose": "susto", "rosto": "choque", "u": 0.5, "v": 0.9, "esc": 1.0}],
    "cartao": {"tipo": "nome", "titulo": "The Jade Emperor", "sub": "ruler of Heaven", "t0": 0.6}}},
  {"texto": "Heaven looked down and laughed. Just a monkey. That was its first *mistake*.", "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {"fundo": "ceu-portao", "cam": {"z": [1.5, 1.6], "x": 0.48, "y": 0.6},
    "atores": [{"id": "imperador", "pose": "parado", "rosto": "riso", "u": 0.5, "v": 0.95, "esc": 1.3}]}},
  {"texto": "He grew up wild, racing a whole tribe up cliffs no animal dared to climb.", "pausa": 0.4,
   "cena": {"fundo": "floresta-macacos", "cam": {"z": [1.15, 1.3], "x": [0.4, 0.6], "y": 0.6}, "fx": ["poeira"],
    "atores": [{"id": "wukong", "pose": "correr", "rosto": "riso", "u": [0.15, 0.75], "v": 0.9, "esc": 0.9},
               {"id": "macaco1", "pose": "correr", "rosto": "sorriso", "u": [0.02, 0.6], "v": 0.93, "esc": 0.8, "fase": 0.4},
               {"id": "macaco2", "pose": "correr", "rosto": "sorriso", "u": [-0.1, 0.48], "v": 0.88, "esc": 0.75, "fase": 0.8}]}},
  {"texto": "Then they found a *waterfall* so loud it swallowed their screams.", "pausa": 0.4,
   "cena": {"fundo": "cachoeira", "cam": {"z": [1.05, 1.2], "x": 0.5, "y": [0.4, 0.6]}, "fx": ["respingo", "neblina"],
    "atores": [{"id": "macaco1", "pose": "susto", "rosto": "medo", "u": 0.3, "v": 0.95, "esc": 0.7},
               {"id": "wukong", "pose": "parado", "rosto": "determinado", "u": 0.55, "v": 0.95, "esc": 0.75, "vira": -1}]}},
  {"texto": "The rule was simple: whoever jumps through and comes back alive becomes *king*.", "pausa": 0.4,
   "cena": {"fundo": "cachoeira", "cam": {"z": [1.4, 1.5], "x": 0.35, "y": 0.62}, "fx": ["respingo"],
    "atores": [{"id": "velho", "pose": "apontar", "rosto": "calmo", "u": 0.32, "v": 0.95, "esc": 0.9}],
    "cartao": {"tipo": "fato", "titulo": "Rule of the tribe", "valor": "1 jump", "sub": "through the falls and back alive = king", "t0": 0.5}}},
  {"texto": "Hundreds of monkeys froze. The stone monkey *jumped*.", "pausa": 0.3,
   "cena": {"fundo": "cachoeira", "cam": {"z": [1.2, 1.7], "x": [0.45, 0.5], "y": [0.65, 0.5]}, "fx": ["velocidade", "respingo", "tremor@1.6"],
    "atores": [{"id": "wukong", "pose": "pular", "rosto": "raiva", "u": [0.2, 0.52], "v": 0.92, "esc": 0.9, "altura": 0.22, "mov": "rapido"}]}},
  {"texto": "Behind the water waited a hidden cave, a stone throne, and room for an *army*.", "pausa": 0.4,
   "cena": {"fundo": "caverna-cortina", "cam": {"z": [1.0, 1.2], "x": [0.4, 0.55], "y": 0.55}, "fx": ["neblina"],
    "atores": [{"id": "wukong", "pose": "triunfo", "rosto": "riso", "u": 0.5, "v": 0.92, "esc": 0.8}],
    "cartao": {"tipo": "nome", "titulo": "Water Curtain Cave", "sub": "Mountain of Flowers and Fruit", "t0": 0.8}}},
  {"texto": "He crowned himself the *Handsome Monkey King*, and ruled for three hundred years.", "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {"fundo": "caverna-cortina", "cam": {"z": [1.35, 1.45], "x": 0.5, "y": 0.6}, "fx": ["dourado"],
    "atores": [{"id": "rei", "pose": "sentar", "rosto": "sorriso", "u": 0.5, "v": 0.86, "esc": 0.95},
               {"id": "macaco1", "pose": "curvar", "rosto": "sorriso", "u": 0.28, "v": 0.95, "esc": 0.8},
               {"id": "macaco2", "pose": "curvar", "rosto": "sorriso", "u": 0.72, "v": 0.95, "esc": 0.8, "vira": -1}],
    "cartao": {"tipo": "fato", "titulo": "His reign", "valor": "300", "sub": "years of feasts, and no enemy alive", "t0": 1.0}}},
  {"texto": "Until the oldest monkey fell at his feet, and never got up.", "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {"fundo": "caverna-cortina", "cam": {"z": [1.5, 1.8], "x": 0.48, "y": 0.68}, "fx": ["escuro"],
    "atores": [{"id": "velho", "pose": "deitado", "rosto": "dor", "u": 0.4, "v": 0.86, "esc": 0.9},
               {"id": "rei", "pose": "susto", "rosto": "choque", "u": 0.62, "v": 0.95, "esc": 0.95, "vira": -1}]}},
  {"texto": "For the first time, the king understood: even he would *die*.", "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {"fundo": "caverna-cortina", "cam": {"z": [2.0, 2.3], "x": 0.5, "y": 0.62}, "fx": ["escuro"], "vinheta": 0.8,
    "atores": [{"id": "rei", "pose": "chorar", "rosto": "choro", "u": 0.5, "v": 0.96, "esc": 1.2}]}},
  {"texto": "So he swore to steal the one thing no king can buy.", "pausa": 0.4,
   "cena": {"fundo": "cachoeira", "cam": {"z": [1.3, 1.1], "x": 0.5, "y": 0.6}, "fx": ["respingo", "raio"],
    "atores": [{"id": "rei", "pose": "lutar", "rosto": "raiva", "u": 0.5, "v": 0.95, "esc": 1.0, "olhos_brilho": true}]}},
  {"texto": "Would you have jumped? Part two, {when_next}.", "pausa": 0.3,
   "cena": {"fundo": "pico-pedra", "cam": {"z": [1.1, 1.0], "x": 0.5, "y": 0.5}, "fx": ["neblina"],
